Senko includes an executable build of XTLS/Xray-core plus the Darwin TUN wait
fix at commit 2ec1657c03a4c368bfabc31e04df0d2c3f1d50a5, modified by the two
patches installed beside this notice:

  senko-core-trim-distro.patch  registers only the features senko configures
  senko-core-trim-conf.patch    moves the unused config loaders, finalmask
                                types and the ECH dns lookup behind the
                                senko_trim build tag the executable is built with

The unmodified source is available at:
https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/tree/2ec1657c03a4c368bfabc31e04df0d2c3f1d50a5

